{"ocrText": "47\nTHE  THOUSAND  AND  FIRST  LIE  OF  THE  CAPITALISTS\n\u201cThe great Russian revolution\u201d can become \u201cgreat\u201d, can\n\u201cconsolidate its position\u201d and \u201cgrow in depth\u201d only if it stops\nsupporting the imperialist \u201ccoalition\u201d government, the\nimperialist war which that government is waging, and the\ncapitalist  class  as  a  whole.\nPravda  No.  73,\nPublished  according  to\nJune  17  (4),  1917\nthe  Pravda  text", "textLayer": [{"text": "47", "x": 86.61, "y": 6.06, "w": 2.27, "h": 1.56, "fontSize": 9.2}, {"text": "THE  THOUSAND  AND  FIRST  LIE  OF  THE  CAPITALISTS", "x": 20.12, "y": 6.11, "w": 57.56, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "\u201cThe great Russian revolution\u201d can", "x": 11.67, "y": 9.53, "w": 49.42, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "become", "x": 61.57, "y": 9.55, "w": 10.11, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "\u201cgreat\u201d, can", "x": 72.18, "y": 9.53, "w": 16.72, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "\u201cconsolidate its position\u201d and \u201cgrow in depth\u201d only if it stops", "x": 8.89, "y": 11.47, "w": 80.01, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "supporting the imperialist \u201ccoalition\u201d government, the", "x": 8.89, "y": 13.39, "w": 80.0, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "imperialist war which that government is waging, and the", "x": 8.89, "y": 15.33, "w": 80.0, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "capitalist  class  as  a  whole.", "x": 8.89, "y": 17.27, "w": 36.65, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "Pravda", "x": 9.72, "y": 21.17, "w": 7.16, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "No.", "x": 17.78, "y": 21.16, "w": 3.23, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "73", "x": 21.93, "y": 21.21, "w": 2.01, "h": 1.28, "fontSize": 7.6}, {"text": ",", "x": 24.18, "y": 21.16, "w": 0.53, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "Published", "x": 66.01, "y": 21.16, "w": 9.43, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "according", "x": 76.36, "y": 21.16, "